  "reading": "The installed build states 2048 as the default for r_decals, counts its decals as permanent plus dynamic, recycles a slot when the pool is full, and states no decal fade convar at all. The fade decals have is a fog fade, stated by the DecalModulate shader through a FOGFADE static flag and four parameters, and every one of the 14 materials that use it - including the bullet decal sheet this build draws from - states exactly $fogfadeend 0.5.",
